<title>USA: Shared Medical Systems Q1 net rises.</title>
<headline>Shared Medical Systems Q1 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>MALVERN, Pa. 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Amounts in thousands except for per share amounts)</p>
<p>						     Quarter Ended</p>
<p>							 March 31</p>
<p>						 1997		 1996(A)</p>
<p>							(unaudited)</p>
<p>Revenues:</p>
<p>  Service and system fees	  $183,980		$162,224</p>
<p>  Hardware sales			 25,899		  10,870</p>
<p>					    209,879		 173,094</p>
